config AUDIO_CODEC_CS47L63
	bool "CS47L63 audio codec"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_CIRRUS_CS47L63_ENABLED
	select SPI
	select GPIO
	help
	  Cirrus Logic CS47L63 low-power audio codec. SPI control, I2S audio
	  on ASP1, differential headphone output and an analog line input,
	  through the audio_codec API. The on-chip DSP cores and their
	  loadable firmware are not supported.
